  "title": "Ruflow launches 60 AI agents for efficient scalable Claw automation #ruflow #aiteamwork automation",
  "description": "Ruflow launched the most powerful Claw tool capable of running 60 AI agents simultaneously. Ranked number one on GitHub and completely free, Ruflow coordinates queen agents to manage teams and technical agents to handle research, coding, testing, and reviewing, all sharing a collective memory to improve continuously. This tool dynamically assigns the appropriate AI model based on task complexity, using cheaper models for simpler tasks and more powerful ones for demanding jobs. This optimization reduces token usage by up to 50% and extends Claw’s effective capacity by up to 250%, offering significant efficiency gains for developers and AI users. As an open-source project, Ruflow represents a shift towards collaborative multi-agent AI systems that enhance productivity and resource management. It holds substantial potential for AI-driven automation, project scalability, and cost-effective machine learning deployments. #Ruflow #ClawTool #AIagents #OpenSourceAI #GitHubTopRank #MultiAgentAI #ArtificialIntelligence #AIAutomation #TokenOptimization #AIworkflow #MachineLearningTools #AIAgents #AIinnovation #DeveloperTools #AIEfficiency",
